BETA

Play it: https://aaronninja1.itch.io/ascendant
Playtest feedback: FEEDBACK.md

### Controls
| Action | Keyboard
| Move | WASD
| Sprint | Left Shift 
| Attack | F 
| Comfort a soul | hold E 
| Pause | P (or Esc)

### Playtest fixes (from Testing Session 1)
- Boss no longer trivial:** comforting a soul now means holding E for 1.2 s. It slows you and cancels if you're hit. Souls rest longer and come back in new spots. 
- Faster sword: cooldown 0.35 s (was 0.7), plus a ready bar under the player. 
- Fair spikes: they only hurt once fully up, with a smaller damage area.
- Clearer HUD: labelled HEALTH and YOUR LIGHT bars, a named boss bar, FED!/STARVED! popups, and a shorter outcome screen.
- Closed arena walls: you can't walk off-screen anymore. 

### Moved to RC or cut
- RC (fixes only): boss pathing around rocks, the boss telegraph audit, walker wind-up readability, the boss knockback "leash", consistent sprite scale.
- RC or cut: tutorial rooms.

### Known bugs
- In the browser, Esc may leave fullscreen instead of pausing. Use P.
- The boss can get stuck behind large rocks (fix planned for RC).
- Burrowers and Sky Divers ignore obstacles on purpose (they travel under and over them).
- Enemies walk onto spikes on purpose (you can lure them in).
